    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/b0b8787afa115fda4734866e64650d11.poster.avif?t=1741719301\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/b0b8787afa115fda4734866e64650d11.webm?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/b0b8787afa115fda4734866e64650d11.mp4?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MeMic </strong>is an atmospheric stealth game with horror elements, where you take on the role of a mimic, able to disguise yourself as everyday objects. Immerse yourself in a dark world where each item becomes a tool for survival, and every enemy step could be your last. Your goal is not only to evade danger but also to explore a world filled with Easter eggs and references to popular games and pop culture, delivering a unique experience for every player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/3f75735f326d6da104f7a7e7f5fdcb87.poster.avif?t=1741719301\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/3f75735f326d6da104f7a7e7f5fdcb87.webm?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/3f75735f326d6da104f7a7e7f5fdcb87.mp4?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disguise Gameplay:</strong>Use your mimic abilities to transform into any nearby object\u2014from chests to furniture. Hide from enemies, study their patrol routes, and choose the perfect moment to strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt and Survive:</strong>Engage in a dangerous game of survival. Remaining unnoticed requires careful planning, as every movement and attack must be timed precisely. Can you evade adventurers and emerge victorious?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Locations: </strong>Every level is crafted with intricate detail\u2014from lighting to environmental animations. These immersive locations pull you into a world where tension grows with each step, and even the smallest detail can either save or doom you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/7bc8f783dd3825acc51655e7c9bc2152.poster.avif?t=1741719301\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/7bc8f783dd3825acc51655e7c9bc2152.webm?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/7bc8f783dd3825acc51655e7c9bc2152.mp4?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Easter Eggs: </strong>MeMic is filled with hidden nods to other games, iconic universes, and humorous touches for players to uncover. Each level holds tiny secrets, allowing players to feel like part of gaming culture as they explore and uncover these surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Rating:</strong>After each level, you\u2019ll receive a rating (from S to D) based on how quickly and safely you completed the objective. Revisit levels to refine your strategies and improve your skills!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready for the Challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world where every corner hides a mystery, and every object can be your sanctuary. MeMic offers a unique blend of suspenseful stealth gameplay with humor and a deeply atmospheric experience. Prepare to explore, disguise, and survive \u2014 can you uncover all the secrets of this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/b0b8787afa115fda4734866e64650d11.poster.avif?t=1741719301\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/b0b8787afa115fda4734866e64650d11.webm?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/b0b8787afa115fda4734866e64650d11.mp4?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MeMic </strong>is an atmospheric stealth game with horror elements, where you take on the role of a mimic, able to disguise yourself as everyday objects. Immerse yourself in a dark world where each item becomes a tool for survival, and every enemy step could be your last. Your goal is not only to evade danger but also to explore a world filled with Easter eggs and references to popular games and pop culture, delivering a unique experience for every player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/3f75735f326d6da104f7a7e7f5fdcb87.poster.avif?t=1741719301\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/3f75735f326d6da104f7a7e7f5fdcb87.webm?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/3f75735f326d6da104f7a7e7f5fdcb87.mp4?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disguise Gameplay:</strong>Use your mimic abilities to transform into any nearby object\u2014from chests to furniture. Hide from enemies, study their patrol routes, and choose the perfect moment to strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt and Survive:</strong>Engage in a dangerous game of survival. Remaining unnoticed requires careful planning, as every movement and attack must be timed precisely. Can you evade adventurers and emerge victorious?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Locations: </strong>Every level is crafted with intricate detail\u2014from lighting to environmental animations. These immersive locations pull you into a world where tension grows with each step, and even the smallest detail can either save or doom you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/7bc8f783dd3825acc51655e7c9bc2152.poster.avif?t=1741719301\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/7bc8f783dd3825acc51655e7c9bc2152.webm?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336430/extras/7bc8f783dd3825acc51655e7c9bc2152.mp4?t=1741719301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Easter Eggs: </strong>MeMic is filled with hidden nods to other games, iconic universes, and humorous touches for players to uncover. Each level holds tiny secrets, allowing players to feel like part of gaming culture as they explore and uncover these surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Rating:</strong>After each level, you\u2019ll receive a rating (from S to D) based on how quickly and safely you completed the objective. Revisit levels to refine your strategies and improve your skills!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready for the Challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world where every corner hides a mystery, and every object can be your sanctuary. MeMic offers a unique blend of suspenseful stealth gameplay with humor and a deeply atmospheric experience. Prepare to explore, disguise, and survive \u2014 can you uncover all the secrets of this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "MeMic is an atmospheric stealth game where you play as a mimic hiding among objects to hunt adventurers. Explore a world filled with Easter eggs, secrets, and references, find the perfect moments to strike, and immerse yourself in a suspenseful survival experience.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Ukrainian",
    "reviews": "\u201cMeMic is a refreshing addition to the stealth game genre. Its unique transformation mechanics and tension-filled atmosphere offer a distinctive experience worth trying. However, be prepared for intense challenges and a steep learning curve. If you like games that test your patience and strategy, MeMic is a sure-fire choice. All in all, MeMic reminds us that sometimes it's good to be on the other side of the coin. After all, who hasn't wanted to be the monster hiding in the wardrobe, waiting to pounce on the unsuspecting hero?\u201d<br>6/10 \u2013 GameHall<br><br>\u201cMeMic is an original and challenging approach to the stealth genre.\u201d<br>XboxManiac<br>",
